Posting on behalf of my fiancee:


Fun :) Congratulate me, everyone! Keely-V the Champion has ascended.

Nethack 3.1 is pretty definitely easier than 3.0; I'd never made it before
without restoring save files.  I admit, I restored once this time, but only
when the wizard's pet hellhound torched the Book of the Dead.  I assumed
this was a bug, although ...

The elemental planes are really annoying when your machine is slow.  I was
reduced to loading up my game every now and then and searching a few rows.
Finally, the wizard cursed my magic marker, and I made some cursed scrolls
of gold detection.  That made things easier.

Accursed Vampire Lord stole my level 30 on the astral plane, though.  It's
a pity; I thought I'd earned the rank :)

